161	// tea.Sequence is unexported — the runtime is its only intended reader, and it
162	// runs the commands one after another rather than concurrently. Its underlying
163	// type is []tea.Cmd, so reflection recovers them without depending on the name.
164	// Order is preserved, which is the whole point of a sequence: a view that emits
165	// "scan starting" before the scan itself relies on the first message arriving
